          "reference": "Genesis 17:1-3",
          "explanation": "Abraham was 75 years old when God called him, and 99 when God promised him a son."
        },
        {
          "id": "herois-u1-l2-e7",
          "kind": "listen",
          "prompt": "Where did Abraham go?",
          "text": "Abraham went to an unknown land.",
          "options": [
            "Unknown land",
            "Egypt",
            "Mesopotamia",
            "Judea"
          ],
          "answer": "Unknown land",
          "reference": "Hebrews 11:8"
        },
        {
          "id": "herois-u1-l2-e8",
          "kind": "speak",
          "prompt": "Read aloud",
          "text": "Abraham believed God and it was credited to him as righteousness.",
          "reference": "Genesis 15:6"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
